      "texto": "Hey Hannah. It was your birthday yesterday, right?\nYes, it was.\nHappy birthday.\nThanks.\nWhen were you born?\nI was born in nineteen ninety-six. What about you?\nI was born in nineteen ninety-four.\nCan I ask you a question?\nSure.\nWhy weren't you at my birthday party yesterday?\nI'm really sorry about that. But yesterday I wasn't free. I was at work until nine p.m.\nNo problem. That's ok.",
